# OPLUS locking strategy subsystem
#
# Config entries defined in arch/arm64/Kconfig.oplus:
#   OPLUS_LOCKING_STRATEGY — master switch
#   OPLUS_LOCKING_OSQ       — optimistic spin queue
#   OPLUS_LOCKING_MONITOR   — lock statistics monitoring
#
# This file exists for directory self-containment; do not
# source it from arch Kconfig (already defined upstream).
